"home.houses.note": "The four names come from Aristotle's art of speaking well, which is exactly what a school of languages teaches.",
"home.houses.p": "Every member, from seven to seventy, can join a House: a friendly community for dinners, friendly competition and the House Cup. Joining is optional, and so is leaving.",
"home.intro.h": "A modern academy for a life lived in more than one language.",
