"home.intro.p1": "For ninety-five years BSML taught people who had crossed an ocean how to feel at home. Now we are opening again, wider than before.",
"home.intro.p2": "Every class at BSML is taught in a language and at a level. You might discuss Aristotle in beginner English, sing in Italian or draw Beacon Hill with instructions in Mandarin. You learn a language by living a full life in it.",
