"schools.h": "Four Schools. Every one taught in a language.",
"schools.p": "Pick a subject, a language and a level. Groups stay small and every course has a named teacher, a written syllabus and a clear outcome.",
"see": "View programme",
"sig": "Signature programme",
"st.1.h": "The founding",
"st.1.p": "BSML opens in Boston to teach English to people newly arrived in America.",
"st.2.h": "Newcomers",
"st.2.p": "Students arrive by ship from Europe and beyond. The school teaches the language of a new life: work, home and citizenship.",
"st.3.h": "A new chapter",
"st.3.p": "A new generation of leadership takes the school forward and widens its reach around the world.",
"st.4.h": "A stone home among the trees",
"st.4.p": "The school moves to a granite church in Roslindale beside the Arnold Arboretum, its home for more than thirty years.",
"st.5.h": "Every accent welcome",
"st.5.p": "Accredited English programmes, test preparation and Medical English bring students from dozens of countries.",
"st.6.h": "A rest",
"st.6.p": "After 95 years, the school rested.",
"st.7.h": "The revival",
"st.7.p": "BSML returns as a modern academy of languages, ideas, arts and music, with a new home in Boston.",
"st.confirm": "Details to confirm with the owner",
"story.h": "A century of new beginnings.",
"story.label": "Our Story",
"story.letter.label": "A letter from our principal",
"story.letter.p1": "For almost a century, this school welcomed people at one of the bravest moments of their lives: arriving somewhere new and starting again in another language.",
"story.letter.p2": "We are bringing it back because that work matters more than ever. The new BSML keeps what made it special, small classes and teachers who know your name, and opens it to ideas, art, music and a healthier way of living.",
"story.letter.sig": "Sample text for the owner to rewrite in her own words",
"story.p": "From a small school for newcomers in 1925 to a modern academy in 2026. These are the moments that shaped BSML.",
